WEBVTT

00:00:00.180 --> 00:00:00.230
{ED}

00:00:45.380 --> 00:00:47.980
<i>I couldn't be more disappointed.</i>

00:00:51.120 --> 00:00:55.990
<i>Did you really learn to build 
from the former world champ?</i>

00:00:58.330 --> 00:01:01.370
<i>So much for being the favorite to win the regional qualifiers.</i>

00:01:10.480 --> 00:01:13.840
<i>You have no talent...</i>

00:01:15.510 --> 00:01:17.580
<i>for Gunpla Battle.</i>

00:02:57.780 --> 00:03:01.650
Well then, I'd like to start
 today's homeroom period.

00:03:02.420 --> 00:03:07.230
<i>The Gunpla I saw yesterday 
seemed to be modified quite a bit,</i>

00:03:07.230 --> 00:03:10.300
<i>but it was based on the Build Burning Gundam.</i>

00:03:10.300 --> 00:03:11.560
<i>I can tell.</i>

00:03:12.400 --> 00:03:15.800
<i>But why did he have that machine?</i>

00:03:19.920 --> 00:03:22.360
<i>There's no point in thinking about it.</i>

00:03:23.370 --> 00:03:25.970
<i>I already quit Gunpla Battle.</i>

00:03:25.970 --> 00:03:27.150
And...

00:03:27.150 --> 00:03:31.690
We have a transfer student 
who'll be studying with you.

00:03:32.140 --> 00:03:33.240
Come in.

00:03:33.870 --> 00:03:35.410
Hello there!

00:03:37.040 --> 00:03:38.340
That's—

00:03:38.340 --> 00:03:40.030
Please introduce yourself.

00:03:40.880 --> 00:03:43.540
I'm Sekai Kamiki, just transferred in!

00:03:43.540 --> 00:03:48.840
My hobby, no, my <i>life</i> is the Jigen Haoh style of kenpo. {kenpo caps?} {no need for caps on kenpo}

00:03:48.840 --> 00:03:51.580
I'll be your opponent any time you like!

00:03:51.580 --> 00:03:54.180
Kamiki, what are you saying?

00:03:54.180 --> 00:03:58.420
A match, of course! I'm inviting them to a martial arts match.

00:03:58.420 --> 00:04:02.060
Our school doesn't allow that.

00:04:02.060 --> 00:04:03.520
So I've heard.

00:04:03.520 --> 00:04:06.350
That's why I decided to join the Gunpla Battle Club.

00:04:07.220 --> 00:04:09.320
I think we're taking membership applications now! {would it be too much if the now was after applications?}

00:04:09.320 --> 00:04:12.890
Please come by! Please! Please do!

00:04:13.380 --> 00:04:17.780
Your seat will be at the back of the classroom, so go sit down.

00:04:17.780 --> 00:04:19.040
Gotcha!

00:04:21.030 --> 00:04:22.990
Huh? You...

00:04:26.460 --> 00:04:28.340
Thanks for yesterday.

00:04:28.340 --> 00:04:32.370
Let's resume the battle later. 
We could even go at it with our fists!

00:04:32.370 --> 00:04:34.510
I don't play Gunpla Battle.

00:04:35.680 --> 00:04:38.600
Then why did you barge in on us yesterday?

00:04:40.160 --> 00:04:41.250
Don't ignore me.

00:04:41.250 --> 00:04:43.750
Kamiki, no whispering.

00:04:43.750 --> 00:04:45.800
Right. I'm sorry.

00:04:47.990 --> 00:04:51.720
<i>Why did I join that Gunpla battle?</i>

00:04:54.970 --> 00:04:57.610
<i>No. I know why...</i>

00:05:00.190 --> 00:05:05.500
<i>I wanted to escape from that earnest gaze.</i>

00:05:17.560 --> 00:05:19.840
Sekai. Sekai!

00:05:23.790 --> 00:05:25.590
Oh, Hoshino.

00:05:25.590 --> 00:05:27.620
It's lunchtime already.

00:05:27.620 --> 00:05:31.720
Hey, I wanted to talk about our
 plans, so let's eat together. Okay?

00:05:31.720 --> 00:05:32.770
Sure.

00:05:32.770 --> 00:05:36.520
That's Hoshino from third year. 
The president of the Battle Club.

00:05:36.520 --> 00:05:41.190
Lucky transfer student, getting to eat lunch with a cute upperclassman!

00:05:41.190 --> 00:05:43.150
Then join the Battle Club.

00:05:44.080 --> 00:05:46.660
Wh-Where's my lunch box?! I can't find it!

00:05:46.660 --> 00:05:48.120
What's going on?!

00:05:49.580 --> 00:05:50.990
Excuse me.

00:05:54.300 --> 00:05:56.620
Wow, she's so beautiful.

00:05:56.620 --> 00:05:59.500
She's Kamiki from the high school, an amateur model.

00:05:59.500 --> 00:06:01.690
I've seen her in a magazine!

00:06:01.690 --> 00:06:03.630
But why is she here?

00:06:04.370 --> 00:06:06.510
You forgot your lunch box.

00:06:07.580 --> 00:06:09.400
You're so careless.

00:06:09.400 --> 00:06:11.470
Thanks, Sis!

00:06:11.470 --> 00:06:13.140
His sister?!

00:06:13.140 --> 00:06:15.730
What's with that transfer student?!

00:06:15.730 --> 00:06:17.600
He's got the perfect setup!

00:06:17.600 --> 00:06:20.080
Darn it!

00:06:21.050 --> 00:06:22.630
I see.

00:06:22.630 --> 00:06:24.900
So Sekai joined the Gunpla Battle Club.

00:06:25.780 --> 00:06:28.870
I'm Fumina Hoshino, the club president.

00:06:28.870 --> 00:06:32.020
Mirai, I'll take good care of your brother.

00:06:32.020 --> 00:06:34.280
Of course, go right ahead.

00:06:34.280 --> 00:06:37.410
But it may be difficult.

00:06:37.410 --> 00:06:42.130
Sekai is rude, careless, simple-minded.

00:06:42.130 --> 00:06:46.090
hot-headed, gluttonous, and did I mention rude? {she says gasatsu twice}

00:06:48.630 --> 00:06:51.050
But he's straightforward.

00:06:52.270 --> 00:06:55.200
Though I only met him yesterday, I could tell.

00:06:57.200 --> 00:06:58.480
Thank you.

00:07:00.740 --> 00:07:07.390
Miss Hoshino, look after Sekai for me.

00:07:07.390 --> 00:07:10.450
I suddenly feel a weight of responsibility.

00:07:12.370 --> 00:07:15.240
President, are you really going to do this?

00:07:15.240 --> 00:07:17.340
Of course.

00:07:17.340 --> 00:07:20.630
I don't have the option not to.

00:07:22.950 --> 00:07:24.000
Kousaka.

00:07:25.070 --> 00:07:26.020
President.

00:07:26.020 --> 00:07:29.530
I'd like to ask you a favor.

00:07:29.530 --> 00:07:31.600
Me?

00:07:34.390 --> 00:07:39.850
Oh, you're the boy from yesterday.
 So you've already joined the Battle Club.

00:07:39.850 --> 00:07:41.230
Welcome aboard.

00:07:42.230 --> 00:07:43.310
Who is this?

00:07:43.310 --> 00:07:44.170
Mr. Ral.

00:07:44.600 --> 00:07:46.400
He's not from our school,

00:07:46.400 --> 00:07:49.570
but we have a special arrangement to have him as our coach.

00:07:50.010 --> 00:07:52.110
I'm Ral. Nice to meet you.

00:07:52.110 --> 00:07:54.990
I'm Sekai Kamiki. Nice to meet you, too.

00:07:59.000 --> 00:08:01.460
You've got good eyes. {is this a gundam reference} {dub line from 79: You've got the eyes of a soldier.}

00:08:01.460 --> 00:08:04.120
Mr. Ral, enough with that.

00:08:04.120 --> 00:08:06.060
Please let me say it.

00:08:06.060 --> 00:08:09.580
He's got a lot of guts too, right? 
Now you're impressed even more? {lulz it is, isnt it. then lets make sure we get the wording right} {dub line: Well, that takes a lot of guts, boy. Now I'm really impressed with you.}

00:08:09.580 --> 00:08:12.380
Come on, let me say it!

00:08:14.300 --> 00:08:17.600
Hoshino, aren't there any other club members?

00:08:17.600 --> 00:08:18.560
No.

00:08:18.560 --> 00:08:22.730
Our Battle Club consists of myself as the president, and you as our only member.

00:08:23.100 --> 00:08:27.650
We had three members last year, 
but they all joined the Plamo Club.

00:08:28.180 --> 00:08:29.150
Plamo Club?

00:08:29.150 --> 00:08:30.570
Plastic Model Club.

00:08:31.060 --> 00:08:33.950
The man you battled yesterday is the president.

00:08:33.950 --> 00:08:36.410
Oh, that praying mantis guy?

00:08:36.410 --> 00:08:38.780
You think so, too?

00:08:38.780 --> 00:08:39.830
I do, I do!

00:08:40.750 --> 00:08:42.960
Who's a mantis?

00:08:43.860 --> 00:08:45.270
Miyaga...

00:08:46.330 --> 00:08:48.940
The council president? Why are you...

00:08:48.940 --> 00:08:50.990
As student council president,

00:08:50.990 --> 00:08:54.170
I have an important message for the Gunpla Battle Club.

00:08:56.220 --> 00:08:59.350
The Plamo Club is absorbing the Gunpla Battle Club?!

00:08:59.350 --> 00:09:04.680
People always complained that we have two very similar clubs.

00:09:04.680 --> 00:09:06.590
So we decided to combine—

00:09:06.590 --> 00:09:08.560
No. I reject the decision!

00:09:08.560 --> 00:09:13.880
But right now, the Battle Club 
 can't even enter the championship.

00:09:13.880 --> 00:09:15.670
We'll get more members!

00:09:15.670 --> 00:09:17.240
That's not enough.

00:09:17.240 --> 00:09:20.170
Then what must we do?

00:09:20.170 --> 00:09:23.840
You need to show something that'll convince the student council executive committee

00:09:23.840 --> 00:09:25.960
and representatives of other clubs.

00:09:26.400 --> 00:09:29.860
Something that will demonstrate the Battle Club's usefulness.

00:09:29.860 --> 00:09:33.880
You mean, we need to beat the Plamo Club at Gunpla Battle.

00:09:34.250 --> 00:09:36.080
I'm glad you grasp the situation.

00:09:36.080 --> 00:09:38.370
Then, we'll hold the battle tomorrow.

00:09:38.370 --> 00:09:42.560
It'll be a 3-on-3 team battle, just like the championship.

00:09:42.560 --> 00:09:43.430
Okay?

00:09:43.880 --> 00:09:45.100
That's fine.

00:09:45.100 --> 00:09:46.490
Wait a minute!

00:09:46.490 --> 00:09:49.020
A 3-on-3 battle? We only have two members...

00:09:49.020 --> 00:09:53.690
Didn't you just say that you'd get more members?

00:09:53.690 --> 00:09:55.610
But tomorrow is just too...

00:09:55.610 --> 00:10:00.160
If not, you'll have to fight with only two people tomorrow.

00:10:02.330 --> 00:10:06.420
Let me tell you about your 
opponents from the Plamo Club.

00:10:06.420 --> 00:10:10.250
There's me, the club president, and vice president Eri Shinoda.

00:10:10.750 --> 00:10:12.050
And then...

00:10:14.170 --> 00:10:16.210
Oh, you're...

00:10:16.210 --> 00:10:17.600
That's...

00:10:18.940 --> 00:10:20.550
Yuu...

00:10:33.320 --> 00:10:34.610
Hoshino.

00:10:36.580 --> 00:10:39.180
I'm not joining the Gunpla Battle Club.

00:10:41.020 --> 00:10:42.360
Why?

00:10:42.360 --> 00:10:44.080
I've lost interest.

00:10:45.570 --> 00:10:50.010
Didn't you promise me that we'd enter the championship once we were in middle school?

00:10:50.010 --> 00:10:52.110
That was just childish nonsense.

00:10:52.110 --> 00:10:53.610
It's all in the past.

00:10:54.400 --> 00:10:55.610
Yuu...

00:10:55.610 --> 00:10:58.360
Please stop calling me that.

00:11:14.520 --> 00:11:16.690
Miss Hoshino's childhood friend?

00:11:17.440 --> 00:11:20.380
They used to play Gunpla Battle together.

00:11:21.240 --> 00:11:24.500
But now he's helping to take down our club.

00:11:25.070 --> 00:11:27.330
How did that happen?

00:11:27.330 --> 00:11:29.840
She doesn't know either.

00:11:29.840 --> 00:11:32.040
She asked, but he wouldn't say.

00:11:32.980 --> 00:11:35.680
Then, it's your turn.

00:11:35.680 --> 00:11:37.460
Using the Jigen Haoh style...

00:11:38.370 --> 00:11:41.300
Yeah, I'll ask him with my fist.

00:11:42.470 --> 00:11:44.310
Personally.

00:11:48.640 --> 00:11:52.690
It looks like you've failed to gather any new members.

00:11:53.150 --> 00:11:55.650
And I'm sure you planned it that way.

00:11:55.650 --> 00:11:57.480
That's not very nice.

00:11:57.480 --> 00:12:00.280
Do I look like such an underhanded guy?

00:12:00.280 --> 00:12:01.150
Yes.

00:12:01.150 --> 00:12:02.490
How rude!

00:12:02.490 --> 00:12:05.070
Enough with the chat. Let's get on with it!

00:12:06.030 --> 00:12:07.490
Time for Gunpla Battle!

00:12:08.410 --> 00:12:11.410
<i>Gunpla Battle combat mode, startup.</i>

00:12:11.830 --> 00:12:14.920
<i>Model damage level, set to B.</i>

00:12:14.920 --> 00:12:17.250
<i>Please set your GP Base.</i>

00:12:18.250 --> 00:12:21.380
<i>Beginning Plavsky particle dispersal.</i>

00:12:25.470 --> 00:12:27.850
<i>Field 9. Canyon.</i>

00:12:28.930 --> 00:12:30.770
<i>Please set your Gunpla.</i>

00:12:36.560 --> 00:12:37.940
<i>Battle start.</i>

00:12:40.030 --> 00:12:43.400
Fumina Hoshino, Powered GM Cardigan, here I go!

00:12:45.030 --> 00:12:47.200
Sekai Kamiki. Let's go!

00:12:50.450 --> 00:12:52.540
<i>Sekai, come with me.</i>

00:12:52.540 --> 00:12:53.210
Right.

00:12:58.710 --> 00:12:59.800
Stay put here.

00:12:59.800 --> 00:13:00.960
<i>Why?</i>

00:13:00.960 --> 00:13:04.930
Yuu... No, Kousaka specializes in sniping.

00:13:04.930 --> 00:13:06.590
Don't rush in, or you'll get shot.

00:13:07.300 --> 00:13:10.510
Listen carefully to what I say.

00:13:13.480 --> 00:13:15.600
As I would expect, it looks like they're not coming out

00:13:15.600 --> 00:13:18.270
because they're scared of Kousaka's sniping.

00:13:18.270 --> 00:13:20.820
<i>President, I'll create an opening.</i>

00:13:21.230 --> 00:13:22.070
Eri?

00:13:22.740 --> 00:13:24.280
<i>That's too much for you!</i>

00:13:27.110 --> 00:13:30.160
<i>I'm here, Battle Club!</i>

00:13:30.160 --> 00:13:30.870
Huh?

00:13:30.870 --> 00:13:33.790
ls that Hobby Hizack kidding around? {wtf?} {it's a real thing. not even from gunpla beginners, it's from fucking char's counterattack :yyyy}

00:13:40.250 --> 00:13:42.920
<i>I lost, President.</i>

00:13:42.920 --> 00:13:44.760
That was careless, Eri.

00:13:45.220 --> 00:13:47.680
<i>I'm very sorry.</i>

00:13:47.680 --> 00:13:49.140
<i>Oops~</i>

00:13:49.140 --> 00:13:51.560
Battle Club defeated one machine.

00:13:52.060 --> 00:13:53.270
Now the odds are—

00:13:59.440 --> 00:14:02.440
Pinpoint aim at the exposed parts.

00:14:02.440 --> 00:14:06.070
That's the power of Yuu's Gunpla.

00:14:06.450 --> 00:14:08.240
<i>That's our Kousaka!</i>

00:14:08.240 --> 00:14:09.950
<i>Back me up!</i>

00:14:12.530 --> 00:14:16.080
<i>Where are you, my pretty kitty?</i>

00:14:28.090 --> 00:14:29.760
<i>Now, Kousaka!</i>

00:14:35.220 --> 00:14:36.640
<i>I found you!</i>

00:14:44.480 --> 00:14:45.650
<i>You!</i>

00:14:45.650 --> 00:14:48.610
This is payback for last time!

00:14:55.620 --> 00:14:57.500
<i>Kousaka, where's my backup?!</i>

00:14:59.500 --> 00:15:01.670
Just as I planned!

00:15:01.670 --> 00:15:03.840
You're amazing, Sekai.

00:15:14.140 --> 00:15:16.970
I'm the president of the Battle Club!

00:15:16.970 --> 00:15:19.140
Even if I'm wounded, I won't lose to the likes of the Plamo Club!

00:15:19.140 --> 00:15:20.230
Shit!

00:15:24.770 --> 00:15:27.690
You can't fire your gun this close, right?

00:15:28.780 --> 00:15:30.950
<i>Why are you blocking her dream?</i>

00:15:30.950 --> 00:15:32.740
<i>Aren't you old friends?!</i>

00:15:32.740 --> 00:15:33.620
Shut up!

00:15:40.250 --> 00:15:41.790
<i>Now let me hear it!</i>

00:15:42.580 --> 00:15:45.790
The loud roar of your fist!

00:15:50.010 --> 00:15:51.970
Wh-What's this power?

00:15:54.550 --> 00:15:58.890
Like I thought, you <i>do</i> want to play Gunpla Battle.

00:15:58.890 --> 00:16:00.100
What?

00:16:00.100 --> 00:16:03.690
<i>You were jealous she was battling, so you got in her way!</i>

00:16:03.690 --> 00:16:04.900
That's not—

00:16:04.900 --> 00:16:07.400
<i>You only whine and run away!</i>

00:16:08.570 --> 00:16:11.070
<i>Don't talk like you know me!</i>

00:16:11.070 --> 00:16:13.240
<i>You wouldn't understand me!</i>

00:16:13.240 --> 00:16:16.200
<i>I may not understand, but I can hear.</i>

00:16:16.200 --> 00:16:20.080
<i>I can hear your roar through my fist!</i>

00:16:20.080 --> 00:16:23.250
What's with that? Are you pretending to be a Newtype?! {lulz}

00:16:23.250 --> 00:16:27.790
This is the true secret of the Jigen Haoh style! {note for later} {would secret fit more?}

00:16:32.630 --> 00:16:34.470
<i>What's this vibration?</i>

00:16:34.470 --> 00:16:36.010
Th-That's...

00:16:39.100 --> 00:16:40.350
That machine...

00:16:40.850 --> 00:16:45.270
It's a heavy mobile armor from Mobile Suit Gundam 00...

00:16:49.690 --> 00:16:51.190
The Agrissa!

00:16:51.820 --> 00:16:55.160
Equipping a heavy mobile armor during the battle?

00:16:55.160 --> 00:16:57.370
That's against championship rules!

00:16:57.910 --> 00:17:01.160
We're not playing in a championship.

00:17:02.000 --> 00:17:05.670
<i>We're testing the ability of your club!</i>

00:17:13.220 --> 00:17:14.420
<i>Hoshino!</i>

00:17:17.050 --> 00:17:19.050
<i>You!</i>

00:17:20.180 --> 00:17:23.640
<i>What do you think of the Agrissa's power, Hoshino?</i>

00:17:24.180 --> 00:17:25.520
The machine is...

00:17:25.520 --> 00:17:29.820
<i>The Battle Club will now be dissolved and absorbed by the Plamo Club.</i>

00:17:30.980 --> 00:17:32.190
Hoshino.

00:17:32.190 --> 00:17:37.820
Starting tomorrow, I'll teach you my
 plastic modeling techniques in detail.

00:17:38.620 --> 00:17:42.120
<i>Thoroughly and painstakingly...{is that some kind of fetish for him} {he seems to forget it's the female mantis that gobbles up the male after sex :y}</i>

00:17:43.410 --> 00:17:44.200
<i>Move!</i>

00:17:44.200 --> 00:17:47.120
How long will you keep lying to yourself?

00:17:48.830 --> 00:17:49.960
<i>I won't lose.</i>

00:17:51.250 --> 00:17:52.550
<i>I can't lose...</i>

00:17:53.880 --> 00:17:58.800
I swore to that person that I'd play Gunpla Battle.

00:17:59.180 --> 00:18:01.430
<i>So I'll enter the championship.</i>

00:18:01.430 --> 00:18:03.220
<i>I won't give up so easily!</i>

00:18:04.390 --> 00:18:07.190
<i>I won't give up on my dream!</i>

00:18:11.770 --> 00:18:16.610
I'll build an awesome Gunpla and 
enter the championship with you.

00:18:17.320 --> 00:18:18.780
I promise!

00:18:19.700 --> 00:18:20.530
Yeah!

00:18:22.240 --> 00:18:24.910
<i>You have no talent...</i>

00:18:27.750 --> 00:18:30.830
You're going to quit Gunpla Battle?

00:18:32.090 --> 00:18:34.590
I can't keep my promise.

00:18:35.260 --> 00:18:37.720
The promise I made with Fumi...

00:18:39.720 --> 00:18:41.640
Hey, Yuu.

00:18:43.100 --> 00:18:45.810
Even if you can't keep your promise,

00:18:46.430 --> 00:18:50.190
Fumi would want to play Gunpla Battle with you.

00:18:50.770 --> 00:18:53.980
That's what I think.

00:18:59.780 --> 00:19:01.530
I...

00:19:04.410 --> 00:19:05.580
I...

00:19:07.120 --> 00:19:09.660
l...! {he says two more after this, wtf ocr}

00:19:14.750 --> 00:19:16.460
Wha... What?!

00:19:18.800 --> 00:19:20.930
<i>Kousaka, why?!</i>

00:19:20.930 --> 00:19:24.810
President, that machine is against regulation.

00:19:25.390 --> 00:19:29.100
I can't accept such an unfair fight!

00:19:29.100 --> 00:19:30.640
<i>Why, all of a sudden?</i>

00:19:30.640 --> 00:19:33.520
Jeez, you're not very honest with yourself.

00:19:33.980 --> 00:19:35.270
<i>Shut up, you amateur!</i>

00:19:35.270 --> 00:19:36.020
<i>Whatever!</i>

00:19:39.950 --> 00:19:42.360
Jigen Haoh style!

00:19:44.910 --> 00:19:48.290
<i>Seisou-Geri: Holy Lance Kick</i>

00:19:44.910 --> 00:19:48.290
<i>Seisou-Geri! {Shine Kick?}{Sacred Spear kick, (holy lance?)}</i>

00:20:02.590 --> 00:20:04.010
Then...

00:20:04.010 --> 00:20:07.180
<i>I'll take Hoshino hostage!</i>

00:20:09.770 --> 00:20:12.270
<i>K-Kousaka!</i>

00:20:13.810 --> 00:20:15.980
<i>I can't believe you!</i>

00:20:18.530 --> 00:20:19.900
<i>Battle ended.</i>

00:20:21.820 --> 00:20:23.660
Student council president.

00:20:23.660 --> 00:20:24.360
Yes.

00:20:25.070 --> 00:20:27.990
I'll talk to them and make sure the Battle Club continues.

00:20:31.580 --> 00:20:35.130
I won't accept a defeat like this!

00:20:35.920 --> 00:20:37.670
It's all right, President.

00:20:37.670 --> 00:20:39.750
Forget all about Hoshino.

00:20:42.420 --> 00:20:45.720
I'll always be by your side.

00:20:47.220 --> 00:20:49.100
E-Eri...

00:20:49.640 --> 00:20:50.520
Eri...

00:20:50.220 --> 00:20:55.020
Did she get shot on purpose?

00:20:53.020 --> 00:20:54.100
Eri...

00:20:55.020 --> 00:20:57.230
Hoshino, we did it!

00:20:57.230 --> 00:20:59.360
Thanks, Sekai!

00:20:59.360 --> 00:21:00.320
And...

00:21:02.530 --> 00:21:03.610
Yuu?

00:21:08.030 --> 00:21:09.740
<i>I wonder if I can do it.</i>

00:21:10.740 --> 00:21:13.580
<i>If I can fight once again.</i>

00:21:15.750 --> 00:21:18.040
<i>No. I will fight.</i>

00:21:18.790 --> 00:21:21.460
<i>With the Gunpla I build.</i>

00:21:21.590 --> 00:21:25.340
<i>So I can keep my promise to her.</i>

00:22:57.930 --> 00:23:00.190
Join the Battle Club, Yuu!

00:23:00.190 --> 00:23:03.020
Hoshino, please stop calling me that.

00:23:03.020 --> 00:23:04.690
Join us, Yuuma!

00:23:04.690 --> 00:23:06.610
And<i> you </i>don't get to call me <i>that</i>!

00:23:07.070 --> 00:23:08.820
Sekai. Hoshino.

00:23:09.320 --> 00:23:10.780
Mirai!

00:23:11.200 --> 00:23:12.700
Are you off to the club?

00:23:12.700 --> 00:23:13.490
Yes!

00:23:14.740 --> 00:23:15.990
You...

00:23:17.040 --> 00:23:20.620
I-I'm Yuuma Kousaka. Middle school, Class 2-B.

00:23:21.500 --> 00:23:22.830
So you're him.

00:23:23.340 --> 00:23:27.710
Since you're with these two, it looks 
like you want to play Gunpla Battle again?

00:23:28.130 --> 00:23:29.630
Y-Yeah...

00:23:31.890 --> 00:23:34.050
Good luck with the championship.

00:23:35.100 --> 00:23:36.100
Yes.

00:23:41.480 --> 00:23:43.230
Sekai, did you hear that?

00:23:43.230 --> 00:23:44.980
Yeah. Absolutely!

00:23:47.070 --> 00:23:49.070
Now that we have three people...

00:23:49.070 --> 00:23:50.780
We can enter the championship!

00:23:50.780 --> 00:23:52.360
Umm, that is...

00:23:52.910 --> 00:23:55.030
Let's do it!

00:23:55.030 --> 00:23:56.790
Let's play Gunpla Battle!

00:24:00.540 --> 00:24:02.870
The Try Fighters have their first practice game!

00:24:02.870 --> 00:24:04.920
With students from a girls' school?

00:24:04.920 --> 00:24:06.880
Next episode, "Her Name is Gyanko."

00:24:06.880 --> 00:24:09.630
They call her Gyanko, but she doesn't use a Gyan?!
